WEBVTT

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:02.309
where I just can't say no
to all of them anymore.

00:40:02.333 --> 00:40:06.434
EP: And what about that it came
with the notion that I can say no

00:40:06.458 --> 00:40:09.143
and you can be frustrated with that,

00:40:09.167 --> 00:40:11.268
and those two shall coexist.

00:40:11.292 --> 00:40:12.559
AG: Yeah.

00:40:12.583 --> 00:40:15.434
EP: It's that thing
that people find impossible to hold,

00:40:15.458 --> 00:40:17.601
it's how do I say no and, you know,

00:40:17.625 --> 00:40:19.768
but what if the other person
doesn't like it?

00:40:19.792 --> 00:40:21.393
They are entitled not to like it.

00:40:21.417 --> 00:40:23.018
And those two will live together,

00:40:23.042 --> 00:40:26.059
that doesn't mean the relationship
will dissolve because of it.

00:40:26.083 --> 00:40:28.934
That's the fear that people
live, it's irrational fear.

00:40:28.958 --> 00:40:30.976
EP: Because the way it gets rationalized